Error [E0992]: a multi-arm `if` needs `==` between the subject and `{`
  --> tests/ui/dispatch_missing_eq.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     if code {
    |     ^^
 Why: `if subject == { … }` marks value dispatch explicitly, so a plain `if cond { … }` body is always statements
 Fix: write `if subject == { … }`
